@startuml SpeakSteps_Patient_Sequence
!theme plain
title SpeakSteps - Patient Exercise Flow Sequence Diagram

participant Patient as patient
participant "Frontend\n(Flutter)" as frontend
participant "Firebase\nAuth" as auth
participant "Backend API" as api
participant "Cueing\nEngine" as cueing
participant "Performance\nCalculator" as perf
participant "ML\nPredictor" as ml
participant "Firestore\nDB" as db

patient -> frontend: 1. Sign In
frontend -> auth: 2. Authenticate
auth -> db: 3. Verify User
db --> auth: 4. User Valid
auth --> frontend: 5. Auth Token
frontend --> patient: 6. Login Success

patient -> frontend: 7. Select Module & Exercise
frontend -> api: 8. Get Exercise Details
api -> db: 9. Query Exercise
db --> api: 10. Return Exercise Data
api --> frontend: 11. Display Exercise

patient -> frontend: 12. Attempt Question
frontend -> api: 13. Submit Response

api -> cueing: 14. Send Response\n(text, response_time, attempts)

cueing -> perf: 15. Calculate Score
perf -> perf: 16. Evaluate Correctness\n& Performance Metrics
perf --> cueing: 17. Return Score & Metrics

cueing -> db: 18. Get Performance History
db --> cueing: 19. Return History

cueing -> ml: 20. Request ML Prediction\n(19 features)
ml -> ml: 21. Extract Features
ml -> ml: 22. Run TFLite Model
ml --> cueing: 23. Return Probability\n(cue needed)

cueing -> cueing: 24. Apply Rule:\nIF (low performance\nOR ML probability > threshold)\nTHEN escalate cue stage
cueing --> api: 25. Cue Decision\n(type, stage, reasoning)

api --> frontend: 26. Return Cue\n(if needed)
frontend --> patient: 27. Display Cue/Feedback

api -> db: 28. Log Response\n& Decision
db --> api: 29. Logged

note right of patient: If cue given:\n- Functional (item's use)\n- Rhyming word\n- Written initial (first letter)\n- Spelling hints\n- Sentence completion\n- Phonemic (sound)\n- Modeling (full answer)

patient -> frontend: 30. Attempt Again\n(if needed)
frontend -> api: 31. Submit Next Response
api -> db: 32. Save Score & Track Progress
db --> api: 33. Updated

api --> frontend: 34. Next Question\nor Session Complete
frontend --> patient: 35. Show Progress

patient -> frontend: 36. View Session Summary
frontend -> api: 37. Get Session Stats
api -> db: 38. Calculate Performance
db --> api: 39. Return Stats\n(accuracy, time, cues used)
api --> frontend: 40. Display Dashboard
frontend --> patient: 41. Show Results

@enduml